# Input

```toml
[table] # header comment
a = 1 # after a
b = [ # after the bracket
  1, # after one
] # after the array
c = { x = 1 } # after an inline table

[[array]] # header comment
d = 2 # after d

[empty] # header comment
# own line after an empty table
[last]
e = 3 # last comment
```

# Options

```
Indent style: Tab
Indent width: 2
Line ending: LF
Line width: 80
Expand: Auto
Trailing newline: true
```

# Output

```toml
[table] # header comment
a = 1 # after a
b = [
	# after the bracket
	1, # after one
] # after the array
c = { x = 1 } # after an inline table

[[array]] # header comment
d = 2 # after d

[empty] # header comment
# own line after an empty table
[last]
e = 3 # last comment
```
